{"title": "Stun Immunity", "pageid": 28385, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stun_Immunity", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Stun Immunity</b> is a passive feature that prevents the wielder from being stunned.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\">Stunned</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/94/Helm_of_Balduran_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Helm_of_Balduran\" title=\"Helm of Balduran\">Helm of Balduran</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Stun Immunity does <i>not</i> protect against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Gaze\" title=\"Stunning Gaze\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunning Gaze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Gaze\" title=\"Stunning Gaze\">Stunning Gaze</a> (as cast by the Bhaal cultists) but does protect against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Blast\" title=\"Mind Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mind Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Mind_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Mind_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Blast\" title=\"Mind Blast\">Mind Blast</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Strike_(Melee)\" title=\"Stunning Strike (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunning Strike (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Stunning_Strike_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Strike_(Melee)\" title=\"Stunning Strike (Melee)\">Stunning Strike (Melee)</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunning_Strike_(Unarmed)\" title=\"Stunning Strike (Unarmed)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/20px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp/30px-Stunning_Strike_Unarmed_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Stunning_S